    "url": "https://github.com/x402-foundation/x402/pull/3220#issuecomment-6010784398",
    "text": "We implemented the single-payment part of this draft (\u00a76, \u00a77) in presign-guard, a pre-sign check for agent payments:\n\n- POST /v1/check takes an optional mandate next to an EIP-3009 signature and turns a payment outside it red before the agent signs (wrong payer/asset/recipient, over perPayment or cap, expired, bad issuer signature, nonce \u2260 binding).\n- presign-guard-wallet's mandatePayer() makes x402 payments with the \u00a77 binding as the EIP-3009 nonce.\n- JCS bytes, digest, signature and the EIP-3009/Permit2 binding values match authority-vectors.json byte for byte.\n\nNot covered: cumulative spend"
